WEBVTT

00:08:57.908 --> 00:09:01.996
and strategy and brand
consistently for years,

00:09:02.037 --> 00:09:03.956
it does become muscle memory.

00:09:04.331 --> 00:09:06.083
It becomes a cultural norm.

00:09:06.834 --> 00:09:11.088
And it is that norm that encourages
an employee to make a gift,

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:13.799
which becomes a story

00:09:13.841 --> 00:09:17.094
which then a very loyal customer
tells to the world.

00:09:17.636 --> 00:09:20.347
So since I am here, Sarah,

00:09:20.389 --> 00:09:22.975
thank you for your kind words that day,

00:09:23.017 --> 00:09:24.643
and for the almonds.

00:09:24.685 --> 00:09:27.021
You helped make it a great day

00:09:27.021 --> 00:09:28.939
because you were right,

00:09:28.981 --> 00:09:30.107
I was hungry.